us entrepreneur with an  inspirational message and that usually  hooks people to want to read more scroll  explore the site learn about us so  whatever it is for your business you  want to have that quick hook we will can  quickly understand your website and you  know hopefully it's for them the next  thing I would do is try to tell your  story  a lot of times entrepreneurs hide behind  their products or services and it's  boring and the way you're going to stand  up for your competition is to quickly  have a store that people can relate to  right people would rather buy from  people then buy from a company and the  more passion and emotion you are about  what you do and and the more you show  that you care the more other people are  going to care but if you're really  deeply passionate about what you're  doing people will pick up on it like a  fever and they'll want to get involved  in it as well so I don't know what your  business is but you know why did you  start it what really excites you about  it what motivates they keep going every  day and whatever product or service you  created why is that so deeply ingrained  into you right so you want to tell your  story so have you know a picture of  yourself hopefully on the homepage that  people can click on and from there  there's your story there's maybe a video  introduction the more it personal you  can make it the greater chances people  will stick around on your website longer  and trust your message right if you have  a hopefully a nice smile you look like  an honest person and they deeply believe  in your story it's easy to tell when  somebody's be icing right when you read  a corporate bio or you see some videos  that are obviously scripted you can tell  that SBS is not authentic and people  tune out but if you're passionate what  you're doing and there's a message that  you have there and you're telling a  story in a way that you deeply believe  in it people will watch and they'll tie  into it and they'll want to be a part of  your company and given the option  between buying from you and buy from  somebody else they don't want to buy  from you because they feel like they  like you and they know it when they  trust you and they want to do business  with you so tell your story right don't  hide behind whatever corporate brand you  have you want to be able to tell your  story that was a big lesson learned for  me actually was when i started my  website was i hid behind the famous  entrepreneur information on our website  and then we have a lot of famous  entrepreneur stories Donald Trump Oprah  Winfrey Bill Gates how they got started  lessons you can learn from them and I  started getting people to write in to  say we want to learn your story like how  did you get started and what are you  doing now and we're interested in  learning more about  what you're up to and so I took that the  heart and started posting some  information and people scooped it up  they just wanted to learn more and and  for me it's being authentic it's what I  love doing helping entrepreneurs i  created this business to try to help  entrepreneurs grow their companies and  be successful and so it's just living  the brand a little bit and people tie  into that story so for yourself whatever  made you want to start this business and  the people that you're helping create  some content around telling that story  so you can hook people in so the first  one is you know create a really strong  value proposition that people can  quickly understand and tie into the  second part is tell your story in an  authentic way that quickly stands out  and really resonates with people and the  third thing I would say is if you want  people to keep coming back to your site  have some kind of way to tie them into a  newsletter so somebody may visit your  website I think it's great you look at  your story great look your products and  services and say great is something i  could use but maybe that ready to buy  now we're really going to go search  online for something else and they may  have loved what you do but people are  busy right we all have day to day lives  that are very busy keep us tied up and  they may forget to come back to you or  they may see how what was that website i  really liked it but i can't remember it  so you you're going to lose a lot of  those people so what i would recommend  doing is try to hook them on to your  website by having a newsletter you can  have some kind of bonus offer a free  download white paper something to entice  people to want to sign up with you and  you start creating a relationship with  people and that way when they are ready  to buy they already know you like you  trust you want to buy from you and  there's an easy way for them to remember  how to get in touch with you so what I  try to think about it is is as dating  before you get married right you're not  going to go up to some random girl in  the Syrian saying will you marry me you  know you have to start dating app to get  to know them you have to see if it's a  fit or not you have to see if you really  don't like them and love them or not and  so the same thing when people are buying  from your your business again depends  how much you know your products and  services cost but the more expensive it  is the more they want to know you and do  the research before they make a decision  so if you can get them signed up to  newsletter and then send them valuable  information on an ongoing basis and be  kind of the trusted expert reliable  source that people go to for whatever  your product or service is then when  they're ready to make a decision or when  their friends are ready to make a  decision you're going to be the person  that they turn to because you're seen as  that expert that they feel like they  know and again the more person you can  make it the better so example on my  newsletter if you sign up for I have an  introduction video so I'd say I want to  introduce myself 