 expert that  they're going to want to buy from so  hopefully that helps  good luck with the website keep us  posted with how you're doing and if you  have other questions please let us know  for those of you watching if you liked  the video give it a thumbs up I love  seemed to come in and makes my day  always when I see thumbs up happening on  the videos and I'd also love to hear  what you have to think if you have a  comment about this video if you liked it  you didn't like it or you have a  suggestion as well feel free to leave it  below and if you have a question for  your own business that I can answer for  you I'd love to be able to try to do it  I always read those comments so feel  free to leave it in the section below  and thank you and I'll see you on the  next episode  you
 

